"National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST), US Department of Commerce": "National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST), US Department of Commerce (ministère américain du Commerce)",
"Needs attention": "À traiter",
"Never change payment details because of an email alone. Call the supplier on the number you already have.": "Ne modifiez jamais des coordonnées de paiement sur la seule foi d'un e-mail. Appelez le fournisseur au numéro que vous avez déjà.",
